# Trivy allowlist — baseline so day-one scanning does not block all work.
# Each entry needs a reason and a tracking reference. Review periodically.

# Generic-chart IaC policy noise on the Helm templates (see SECURITY_AUDIT.md F-07
# discussion): these fire because the chart's default image is not pinned to a
# specific cloud registry / not tagged by digest. Operators set image.repository
# and image.tag for their own registry; the securityContext HIGH findings are
# already remediated.
AVD-KSV-0013  # image tag ":latest" — chart default; operators pin their tag
AVD-KSV-0032  # restrict image to *.azurecr.io — org policy, not applicable to OSS chart
AVD-KSV-0033  # restrict image to GCR — org policy, N/A
AVD-KSV-0034  # restrict image to private registry — org policy, N/A
AVD-KSV-0035  # restrict image to ECR — org policy, N/A
AVD-KSV-01010 # ConfigMap "sensitive content" — false positive on config comments
